{
  "name": "Words of Creation",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have mastered two of the Words of Creation: the words of life and death. You therefore always have the Power Word Heal and Power Word Kill spells prepared. When you cast either spell, you can target a second creature with it if that creature is within 10 feet of the first target. You can cast either spell once without expending a spell slot. You regain the ability to cast these spells this way when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
